 "detector_mapping": {
  "_about": "Only detectors whose match is itself data of the category. Detectors that name a provider, a bank, a code system or a mention of a category (npi_context, us_dea_number_context, bank_routing, swift_bic_code, clinical_trial_nct, biometric_reference) are deliberately left out. Human 'omic data other than genomic and biometric identifiers have no detector: those categories are reported as not evaluated, never as below threshold.",
